WEBVTT

00:00:00.944 --> 00:00:05.814
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:06.854 --> 00:00:12.314
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:29.104
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:29.844 --> 00:00:34.474
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.714 --> 00:00:40.984
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:46.654
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.064 --> 00:00:50.654
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:55.604
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.404 --> 00:01:00.804
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.544 --> 00:01:08.504
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.584 --> 00:01:14.484
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.554 --> 00:01:21.114
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.394 --> 00:01:27.334
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:02:12.714 --> 00:02:15.014
That's all of them now.

00:02:27.124 --> 00:02:29.064
Everything's okay now.

00:02:29.134 --> 00:02:32.064
Why did that have to happen?

00:02:32.264 --> 00:02:32.924
Well...

00:02:33.004 --> 00:02:33.654
Hey...

00:02:34.804 --> 00:02:36.424
What did this guy look like?

00:02:36.504 --> 00:02:37.804
The guy?

00:02:37.874 --> 00:02:38.894
You saw, didn't you?

00:02:38.974 --> 00:02:40.874
I don't remember that well.

00:02:41.544 --> 00:02:43.004
But it was a woman.

00:02:43.744 --> 00:02:44.974
She was strong.

00:02:45.574 --> 00:02:47.744
I didn't even last two hits.

00:02:48.244 --> 00:02:52.114
I just heard that Gord got PK'd.

00:02:52.314 --> 00:02:54.514
It couldn't be the same
person, could it?

00:02:54.954 --> 00:02:57.424
What are you thinking, Sakisaka?

00:02:57.624 --> 00:03:00.324
Maybe Tabby wasn't PK'd
at random...

00:03:00.394 --> 00:03:02.654
...and that the Brigade
is being targeted.

00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:04.634
But Gord isn't a member
anymore.

00:03:04.694 --> 00:03:07.534
Besides, even if he was,
why target the Brigade?

00:03:07.904 --> 00:03:09.394
I'd like to know.

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:11.674
Did she say anything?

00:03:11.874 --> 00:03:14.344
She asked me about the Brigade.

00:03:14.404 --> 00:03:14.774
And?

00:03:14.844 --> 00:03:17.864
I told her I just joined
and didn't know anything.

00:03:17.944 --> 00:03:20.534
Stop mumbling just because
you got PK'd.

00:03:21.984 --> 00:03:23.274
What about you?

00:03:24.514 --> 00:03:26.174
Arguing isn't allowed here.

00:03:26.254 --> 00:03:28.684
But Shino, since this guy joined-

00:03:28.754 --> 00:03:31.624
Nothing must be done
out of revenge.

00:03:31.854 --> 00:03:32.584
But...!

00:03:32.764 --> 00:03:34.284
This is a time for patience.

00:03:34.364 --> 00:03:35.694
It makes me angry.

00:03:35.764 --> 00:03:37.994
But I don't like PK'ing
or getting PK'd...

00:03:38.064 --> 00:03:39.554
...so I agree with Shino!

00:03:39.964 --> 00:03:42.164
It's just a game,
so it's got to be fun!

00:03:43.474 --> 00:03:44.364
Well, what can we do?

00:03:48.604 --> 00:03:53.564
I wonder what
the Twilight Brigade is up to now.

00:03:54.214 --> 00:03:56.844
If you're concerned,
you should go back to them.

00:03:57.214 --> 00:03:59.314
My interest doesn't
go as far as concern.

00:04:00.084 --> 00:04:04.214
When she came after me
I said I didn't know anything.

00:04:04.624 --> 00:04:08.024
But I realized I really
don't know anything.

00:04:09.934 --> 00:04:12.264
We don't have to worry about
any of this...

00:04:13.564 --> 00:04:16.534
...as long as you're not planning to
get involved with them.

00:04:18.074 --> 00:04:22.004
It's not easy to make a clean break.

00:04:28.344 --> 00:04:31.184
It's about the job I received
the other day.

00:04:31.354 --> 00:04:32.874
The other day? Be specific.

00:04:33.284 --> 00:04:36.884
Um, you wanted me to
check out a particular PC.

00:04:36.954 --> 00:04:38.614
You checked him out, right?

00:04:38.694 --> 00:04:39.784
Did you get a complaint?

00:04:39.864 --> 00:04:43.424
No, I received a strange item
along with the compensation.

00:04:43.634 --> 00:04:45.494
I'm not sure what to do about it.

00:04:45.964 --> 00:04:48.404
I don't mind if you receive
overpayment.

00:04:48.464 --> 00:04:50.834
But, it's an item
I've never seen before.

00:04:54.474 --> 00:04:56.444
Where's the guy that brought this?

00:04:56.774 --> 00:04:58.404
He went somewhere.

00:04:59.014 --> 00:05:01.314
Contact the one that brought
this, immediately.

00:05:01.714 --> 00:05:03.184
I'll take care of this.

00:05:03.314 --> 00:05:03.974
Okay.

00:05:11.724 --> 00:05:13.854
Haseo, wait a second!

00:05:14.864 --> 00:05:16.624
It's too dangerous to be
out on your own.

00:05:18.164 --> 00:05:20.824
I'm not like you.

00:05:22.204 --> 00:05:24.434
Just don't follow me.

00:05:32.544 --> 00:05:35.674
Hey, is this a coincidence?

00:05:36.484 --> 00:05:37.454
Don't know.

00:05:38.214 --> 00:05:42.084
Why? Another Lost Ground...
at a time like this?

00:05:42.724 --> 00:05:44.954
There was a dragon sleeping
at the bottom of this lake.

00:05:45.894 --> 00:05:48.084
In order to gain strength...

00:05:48.164 --> 00:05:52.654
...it was eating the monsters and
travelers that looked into the lake.

00:05:54.734 --> 00:05:55.824
Then...

00:05:57.004 --> 00:05:58.334
...the dragon appeared.

00:06:00.704 --> 00:06:01.264
Yeah.

00:06:02.244 --> 00:06:04.714
That's the kind of place this is.

00:06:05.274 --> 00:06:09.234
It would be nice if things would
go smoothly from now on.

00:06:09.684 --> 00:06:10.444
It will.

00:06:13.424 --> 00:06:17.084
They're not the types to disappear
just because someone got PK'd.

00:06:17.854 --> 00:06:20.694
Why don't you talk to them?

00:06:21.664 --> 00:06:24.464
That's your job.

00:06:25.594 --> 00:06:26.824
I know, but...

00:06:38.714 --> 00:06:40.504
Do you know what that is?

00:06:41.284 --> 00:06:41.974
Yeah.

00:06:42.614 --> 00:06:43.814
It's nostalgic.

00:06:45.814 --> 00:06:46.914
Nostalgic?

00:06:47.554 --> 00:06:50.784
There were lots of them
in the previous game.

00:06:51.354 --> 00:06:52.754
Where did you get it?

00:06:52.824 --> 00:06:54.624
Its origins are a mystery.

00:06:54.694 --> 00:06:57.754
It seems it was being passed
around among different PC's.

00:06:57.834 --> 00:06:58.924
I see.

00:06:59.264 --> 00:07:01.134
No one knows what to do with it.

00:07:02.204 --> 00:07:04.864
You can use it to
stir things up with the Brigade.

00:07:05.174 --> 00:07:07.144
Depending on how you use it...

00:07:08.544 --> 00:07:10.904
...some interesting things
can happen.

00:07:11.344 --> 00:07:12.314
I see.

00:07:12.374 --> 00:07:13.864
Just wait a second!

00:07:14.584 --> 00:07:16.874
I deal with any work
concerning the Brigade.

00:07:17.014 --> 00:07:20.414
It's better if you let Tawaraya
handle that item.

00:07:22.484 --> 00:07:23.424
Well...

00:07:24.754 --> 00:07:26.024
...I'm on my way.

00:07:39.604 --> 00:07:41.304
You're always here, huh?

00:07:41.744 --> 00:07:43.534
I thought you'd come.

00:07:46.084 --> 00:07:47.474
I want to meet Gord.

00:07:47.684 --> 00:07:48.574
Where is he?

00:07:48.644 --> 00:07:49.774
Is this your friend?

00:07:50.754 --> 00:07:53.484
I'm Tabby, and I joined
the Twilight Brigade!

00:07:53.684 --> 00:07:54.714
Nice to meet you!

00:07:54.784 --> 00:07:56.654
Call me Phyllo, young lady.

00:07:56.994 --> 00:08:00.054
You've been through a lot,
haven't you?

00:08:00.324 --> 00:08:01.454
Whatever.
Just tell me.

00:08:01.594 --> 00:08:04.064
He's probably
somewhere in town.

00:08:04.164 --> 00:08:04.784
Did you meet him?

00:08:04.864 --> 00:08:07.164
No, he's with Bset.

00:08:08.304 --> 00:08:11.434
It seems someone was
after her as well.

00:08:11.504 --> 00:08:12.364
Bset, too?

00:08:12.434 --> 00:08:15.304
Yes, I think she's
still in the Alchemy Area.

00:08:16.074 --> 00:08:18.514
Bset is always there.

00:08:18.914 --> 00:08:20.534
You've been there, right?

00:08:23.714 --> 00:08:26.084
So you come to me
after Haseo, huh?

00:08:27.554 --> 00:08:29.644
Oh, don't say it like that.

00:08:29.754 --> 00:08:32.484
You must pursue anything
that has profit potential.

00:08:32.694 --> 00:08:34.454
That's the principle of business.

00:08:36.794 --> 00:08:37.594
Profit?

00:08:39.504 --> 00:08:41.334
I mean, we could use you.

00:08:41.704 --> 00:08:43.534
I'm not sure if
I'm supposed to be flattered.

00:08:43.604 --> 00:08:45.164
Um, here!

00:08:46.874 --> 00:08:48.504
Ovan wants that item.

00:08:49.304 --> 00:08:50.794
This?

00:08:52.514 --> 00:08:56.744
Honestly, I don't know
what he hopes to do with it.

00:09:00.424 --> 00:09:01.284
However...

00:09:03.554 --> 00:09:05.494
Why are you making it out
to be a big deal?

00:09:05.654 --> 00:09:08.124
That item is not in the specs.

00:09:09.834 --> 00:09:11.424
Not in the specs?

00:09:12.934 --> 00:09:14.734
Key of the Twilight!

00:09:15.234 --> 00:09:18.324
Perhaps it has something
to do with that.

00:09:21.004 --> 00:09:22.994
So ask Ovan about it.

00:09:24.144 --> 00:09:26.474
He is your Guild Master, right?

00:09:30.154 --> 00:09:32.844
You really don't know anything?

00:09:34.254 --> 00:09:35.884
Now, that's a problem.

00:09:36.084 --> 00:09:38.954
If he doesn't pass on information
to his members...

00:09:39.024 --> 00:09:41.294
...it means he doesn't
trust you guys.

00:09:41.924 --> 00:09:43.414
Or maybe...

00:09:43.494 --> 00:09:45.124
...he's just using the guild...

00:09:45.194 --> 00:09:47.724
...and plans to take the treasure
for himself.

00:09:49.064 --> 00:09:50.194
That can't be...

00:09:52.504 --> 00:09:54.944
Why don't you work with me?

00:10:03.614 --> 00:10:05.344
I'll keep this.

00:10:10.954 --> 00:10:12.684
Nice doing business with you.

00:10:28.544 --> 00:10:29.374
Hey.

00:10:30.514 --> 00:10:31.494
Where's Gord?

00:10:31.874 --> 00:10:33.364
He's not around anymore.

00:10:34.114 --> 00:10:35.014
Did he log out?

00:10:35.284 --> 00:10:35.974
No.

00:10:36.784 --> 00:10:39.274
But leave him alone
for a little while.

00:10:41.154 --> 00:10:44.414
Gord is going around
saying, "Defeat Ovan."

00:10:44.494 --> 00:10:46.324
You know that, right?

00:10:46.724 --> 00:10:51.634
He was pretty shocked
after being PK'd by some PC.

00:10:52.364 --> 00:10:53.994
Defeat Ovan?

00:10:54.134 --> 00:10:55.494
Do you feel the same, Haseo?

00:10:56.434 --> 00:10:57.864
Of course not!

00:10:58.404 --> 00:10:59.374
Are you a newcomer?

00:10:59.844 --> 00:11:00.934
I'm Tabby!

00:11:01.374 --> 00:11:02.234
Who are you?

00:11:02.914 --> 00:11:04.774
Are you targeting Ovan, too?

00:11:05.474 --> 00:11:06.464
Certainly not.

00:11:07.114 --> 00:11:08.584
So, what is this about?

00:11:08.684 --> 00:11:10.444
Did you get PK'd, too?

00:11:13.924 --> 00:11:17.084
I only got chased
because I was in town.

00:11:17.354 --> 00:11:19.224
Any idea about who it was?

00:11:19.394 --> 00:11:20.514
Why do you want to know?

00:11:21.124 --> 00:11:23.494
With the way you are now,
your revenge will only backfire.

00:11:23.564 --> 00:11:24.324
But...

00:11:26.234 --> 00:11:27.204
Ender.

00:11:28.004 --> 00:11:28.664
Ender?

00:11:28.934 --> 00:11:29.924
You know her?

00:11:30.634 --> 00:11:32.664
No, but why is TaN...

00:11:32.774 --> 00:11:33.464
Huh?

00:11:35.474 --> 00:11:37.804
Haseo! Wait!

00:11:43.754 --> 00:11:46.414
You know Ender, don't you?

00:11:47.184 --> 00:11:48.154
Don't you?

00:11:48.224 --> 00:11:49.344
No, I don't!

00:11:50.154 --> 00:11:51.184
But, just a while ago...

00:11:51.824 --> 00:11:53.294
Don't follow me anymore.

00:11:53.364 --> 00:11:55.264
I told you it's dangerous
on your own.

00:11:55.324 --> 00:11:57.824
Well, Sakisaka's on his own.

00:11:58.464 --> 00:11:59.864
You don't get it.

00:12:00.334 --> 00:12:01.664
He's fine.

00:12:01.804 --> 00:12:02.354
Huh?

00:12:03.004 --> 00:12:04.434
Because he's my teacher!

00:12:04.834 --> 00:12:06.204
He can't lose!

00:12:09.204 --> 00:12:10.434
Anyway, you're annoying.

00:12:23.554 --> 00:12:24.254
What?

00:12:25.394 --> 00:12:26.684
Wh-Why are you here?

00:12:27.064 --> 00:12:29.964
What do you mean?
I was chasing Haseo.

00:12:30.594 --> 00:12:32.394
Where were you?

00:12:33.304 --> 00:12:34.284
I was just...

00:12:35.464 --> 00:12:37.194
I'm going back home.

00:12:48.684 --> 00:12:51.444
Hey, that guy we just
passed by...

00:12:51.514 --> 00:12:52.984
Wasn't that Haseo?

00:12:53.124 --> 00:12:54.674
He's already switched guilds?

00:12:54.754 --> 00:12:57.984
Well, the Twilight Brigade
is nothing compared to TaN.

00:12:59.454 --> 00:13:00.554
What did he say?

00:13:01.894 --> 00:13:04.724
Why did you call me here?

00:13:05.564 --> 00:13:07.654
I'd like to hear your thoughts.

00:13:10.804 --> 00:13:11.634
My thoughts?

00:13:11.804 --> 00:13:14.934
In order to get to where
the Key of the Twilight is...

00:13:15.004 --> 00:13:18.564
...you need to use an item
that's not in the specs.

00:13:18.944 --> 00:13:20.644
An item that's not in the specs?

00:13:21.114 --> 00:13:24.604
What do you think
of this information?

00:13:25.484 --> 00:13:26.144
And?

00:13:26.624 --> 00:13:27.644
What do mean "and"?

00:13:27.724 --> 00:13:29.414
What am I supposed to think?

00:13:29.854 --> 00:13:31.284
Do you think it's true?

00:13:33.124 --> 00:13:33.854
Beats me.

00:13:34.194 --> 00:13:36.824
Aren't you a member
of the Twilight Brigade?

00:13:37.234 --> 00:13:39.164
The Key of the Twilight is...

00:13:39.234 --> 00:13:40.994
No matter what the information...

00:13:41.064 --> 00:13:45.364
...it has nothing to do with you.

00:13:50.374 --> 00:13:52.904
But it does, you see.

00:13:57.584 --> 00:14:02.314
I had Tawaraya directly
leak the information.

00:14:03.554 --> 00:14:04.924
Ender...

00:14:05.254 --> 00:14:07.244
You know what to do next.

00:14:07.864 --> 00:14:08.584
Yes.

00:14:09.624 --> 00:14:12.564
Go for the weakest link.

00:14:24.374 --> 00:14:26.574
Who exactly are you?

00:14:27.114 --> 00:14:30.604
What?
Are you interested in me now?

00:14:31.084 --> 00:14:35.614
You're the one sniffing around
the Brigade and PK'ing, right?

00:14:35.724 --> 00:14:37.084
So, what about it?

00:14:37.154 --> 00:14:38.054
Why?

00:14:39.154 --> 00:14:43.524
I'm just looking
for the Key of the Twilight.

00:14:43.634 --> 00:14:45.294
Hey, there's Haseo!

00:14:46.194 --> 00:14:47.664
Just do your best.

00:14:47.904 --> 00:14:49.454
Haseo!

00:14:49.764 --> 00:14:51.394
Haseo!

00:14:53.174 --> 00:14:56.044
What's up?
You look really angry!

00:14:56.514 --> 00:14:57.234
Did something happen?

00:14:57.674 --> 00:14:58.934
Nothing.

00:15:01.644 --> 00:15:05.144
I was worried about you,
you know.

00:15:07.184 --> 00:15:07.984
Sissy!

00:15:12.394 --> 00:15:14.224
That PK'er.

00:15:17.034 --> 00:15:19.434
It's rare to see you in town.

00:15:20.034 --> 00:15:21.224
Shut up!

00:15:21.304 --> 00:15:25.034
If you have time to ask me questions
go and get some information!

00:15:27.074 --> 00:15:27.934
Idiot.

00:15:38.284 --> 00:15:39.374
That's her...

00:16:02.074 --> 00:16:02.834
Haseo...

00:16:04.144 --> 00:16:08.474
What's your take on this information
on the item that's not in the specs?

00:16:09.484 --> 00:16:13.614
I think we should check it out
regardless...

00:16:14.484 --> 00:16:17.944
...if that thing is connected
to the Key of the Twilight.

00:16:18.894 --> 00:16:20.584
Then, go check it out.

00:16:21.164 --> 00:16:25.294
If the information is correct,
you can take credit for it.

00:16:28.034 --> 00:16:29.554
Haseo smiled!

00:16:30.774 --> 00:16:31.664
No, I didn't.

00:16:34.304 --> 00:16:38.474
Now, there's something
I want you guys to do.

00:16:38.744 --> 00:16:39.834
What is it? What is it?

00:16:40.244 --> 00:16:42.044
Find an item called a
"Virus Core"...

00:16:42.114 --> 00:16:44.814
...that's not in the manual.

00:16:45.114 --> 00:16:46.344
Virus Core?!!

00:16:46.684 --> 00:16:47.774
You know about it?

00:16:49.284 --> 00:16:49.654
No.

00:16:50.494 --> 00:16:53.824
Shino, show them where to go.

00:16:55.024 --> 00:16:55.494
Okay.

00:17:05.774 --> 00:17:11.004
Virus Cores are items
only found in the Lost Grounds.

00:17:11.074 --> 00:17:12.874
You mean it's a rare item?

00:17:12.974 --> 00:17:14.074
Exactly.

00:17:14.444 --> 00:17:16.074
Let's spread out and look for it.

00:17:16.144 --> 00:17:18.874
Are there many of them?

00:17:18.954 --> 00:17:20.184
I'm not sure...

00:17:20.254 --> 00:17:21.844
...but I think there's more than one.

00:17:22.624 --> 00:17:23.884
What does it look like?

00:17:23.954 --> 00:17:27.154
Let's see...
I think it's shaped like this.

00:17:27.464 --> 00:17:29.054
It's really small.

00:17:29.364 --> 00:17:30.554
I wonder if we can find them.

00:17:31.134 --> 00:17:33.094
If you give up before you start...

00:17:33.164 --> 00:17:35.654
...you won't even find
what's yet to be found.

00:17:36.204 --> 00:17:37.034
That's right!

00:17:37.334 --> 00:17:38.804
I'll be the first one to find one!

00:17:39.374 --> 00:17:41.774
Think it's a good idea we split up?

00:17:42.044 --> 00:17:44.904
We are being targeted, you know.

00:17:45.244 --> 00:17:47.504
Sakisaka, you worry too much.

00:17:48.544 --> 00:17:49.514
You think?

00:17:49.884 --> 00:17:51.904
Fine, then. Let's give it a shot.

00:18:10.034 --> 00:18:12.434
It's beautiful here, isn't it?

00:18:15.044 --> 00:18:19.204
But I don't think we'll find
that item in a place like this.

00:18:19.944 --> 00:18:22.414
Whatever the information...

00:18:22.484 --> 00:18:24.174
...the Twilight Brigade
always tries.

00:18:24.554 --> 00:18:27.344
You wanted to
check it out as well, right?

00:18:37.394 --> 00:18:38.524
I wonder what that is.

00:18:38.594 --> 00:18:40.194
I don't know either.

00:18:41.264 --> 00:18:42.594
But that's okay.

00:18:43.264 --> 00:18:47.134
We are surrounded by things
we don't know or understand.

00:18:47.204 --> 00:18:50.004
And not just in the game world.

00:18:50.074 --> 00:18:52.904
It's the same in the real world
at school or work...

00:18:52.974 --> 00:18:54.414
...or the part-time job at a store.

00:18:56.884 --> 00:18:59.684
It's because we don't know
that there is the joy of discovery.

00:18:59.854 --> 00:19:02.874
It's because we don't comprehend
that there is the joy of understanding.

00:19:03.754 --> 00:19:05.584
Even if you don't know the rules...

00:19:05.654 --> 00:19:10.154
...just fully experience your role
and take things as they come.

00:19:15.764 --> 00:19:20.134
There's nothing left to enjoy
if you know everything.

00:19:31.484 --> 00:19:32.314
Tabby!

00:19:32.984 --> 00:19:34.574
The woman who PK'd me!

00:19:34.654 --> 00:19:35.144
What?!

00:19:43.734 --> 00:19:46.134
Our speed should have increased!
So, hurry!

00:19:52.034 --> 00:19:53.934
It doesn't matter where you run.

00:19:54.744 --> 00:19:59.644
You're all trapped mice, anyway.

00:20:02.114 --> 00:20:05.554
Ah, it's so quiet.

00:20:19.764 --> 00:20:21.294
Why was that woman...?

00:20:21.364 --> 00:20:23.834
She appeared as if
she was targeting us.

00:20:25.134 --> 00:20:27.574
Haseo, did you do something?

00:20:27.844 --> 00:20:28.394
Me?

00:20:29.074 --> 00:20:29.804
Why?

00:20:30.144 --> 00:20:34.604
Well, I heard a rumor
that you switched to TaN.

00:20:34.814 --> 00:20:36.804
I heard it on the street.

00:20:37.084 --> 00:20:37.774
Tabby!

00:20:37.914 --> 00:20:39.384
But something isn't right!

00:20:39.454 --> 00:20:40.184
Huh?

00:20:40.254 --> 00:20:42.724
Where did you get
the information...

00:20:42.784 --> 00:20:44.014
...you gave to Ovan?

00:20:44.124 --> 00:20:46.144
What's all this "Defeat Ovan"
business?

00:20:52.534 --> 00:20:54.524
Fine, then.

00:20:54.964 --> 00:20:55.904
Haseo...

00:20:56.604 --> 00:20:59.094
There won't be any complaints
if I quit, right?

00:21:05.974 --> 00:21:07.874
Tabby, you went too far.

00:21:12.184 --> 00:21:13.704
Goodness me.

00:21:31.704 --> 00:21:33.724
This isn't like you.

00:21:33.804 --> 00:21:35.434
Are you feeling down?

00:21:38.574 --> 00:21:40.274
Huh, Haseo?

00:21:40.744 --> 00:21:41.834
Get away from me!

00:21:55.064 --> 00:21:58.824
If you need anything,
don't hesitate to contact me again.

00:22:06.574 --> 00:22:09.204
So, Haseo is...

00:22:30.094 --> 00:22:33.694
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.764 --> 00:22:37.204
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.474 --> 00:22:41.204
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:41.274 --> 00:22:45.304
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.814 --> 00:22:52.414
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.484 --> 00:22:56.114
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.184 --> 00:23:03.424
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.494 --> 00:23:07.154
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.234 --> 00:23:10.934
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:11.004 --> 00:23:17.934
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.114 --> 00:23:21.844
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.914 --> 00:23:24.944
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:25.014 --> 00:23:32.484
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.724 --> 00:23:35.924
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:35.994 --> 00:23:40.024
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.134 --> 00:23:43.724
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.804 --> 00:23:47.364
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.444 --> 00:23:51.174
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.244 --> 00:23:55.014
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:55.884 --> 00:23:57.214
Next Episode...
